                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Supreme Court just gave states the green light to block Medicaid patients from accessing care at Planned Parenthood.\n\nThis decision will mean fewer available reproductive health services, delayed cancer diagnoses, and more maternal deaths.\n\nThis will cost lives.",
