                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republicans voted to rip health care away from 300,000 Virginians, cut vital food assistance like SNAP, and shutter rural hospitals.\n\nWhy did they vote for this chaos and cruelty? To give tax breaks to their ultra wealthy friends, of course.\nhttps://t.co/Cy7LoAbo08",
