                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "President Johnson signed Medicare and Medicaid into law 60 years ago, expanding affordable health care to millions.\n\nBut right now, these programs are under threat due to the GOP budget that will close rural hospitals and slash the health care of more than 320,000 Virginians.\n\nIn Congress, I'm committed to working hard to deliver the quality, affordable health care that every Virginian and American across our country deserves.",
