                "quoted_status_profile_username": "DailyProgress",
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Ripping health care away from 1/3 of the nearly 415,000 Virginians covered through the ACA isn\u2019t the answer.\n\u00a0\nBy refusing to extend tax credits, extreme Washington Republicans would force many to go without essential care.\n\u00a0\nI won\u2019t stand idly by while Virginians lose coverage.",
