                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Rising costs could impact more than 17 million Americans who purchase health insurance through the ACA marketplace.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nI\u2019m committed to protecting access to quality health care and remain ready to pass a budget to keep these costs from going up.\u00a0\n\nhttps://t.co/VrK4DWrTIV",
