                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As Northern Virginia\u2019s largest care provider for patients with HIV/AIDS, Inova\u2019s Juniper Program plays a vital role in ensuring accessible, compassionate care for our community.\n\nI was glad to visit their facility in Prince William County last week to see this work in action. https://t.co/3eamQIf4g4",
