                "text": "Open enrollment for health insurance on the Marketplace is ongoing!\u00a0\u00a0\n\n\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0fMonday, December 15 is the final day to sign up for coverage beginning on January 1, 2026.\u00a0\u00a0\n\u00a0\nTo review coverage options and find the plan that works best for you, visit https://t.co/Hncjfqrxg5.",
