                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8I was among the first signatories of a petition to force a vote on a clean, three-year extension of the ACA tax credits.\n\nThe Democratic petition now has 218 BIPARTISAN signatures.\n\nFinally, a majority of House members are on the record working to stop health care premiums from skyrocketing.\n\n@SpeakerJohnson should allow a vote now.",
