                "text": "Scams are far too common in the rehab industry \u2014 bad actors too often exploit vulnerable people and our health care system for profit.\u00a0\n\nI\u2019m leading bipartisan legislation with @RepMichaelRulli to stop deceptive, predatory practices that mislead patients and abuse insurance systems. It\u2019s time to protect people in recovery, not the scammers who prey on them.",
